Instella port for GPT-QModel
============================

This directory contains an independent Apache-2.0 implementation of the
Instella decoder-only language model architecture (AMD Instella, e.g. the
published amd/Instella-3B checkpoints). It was written from a behavioral
specification in a clean-room process, without reference to any third-party
Instella source code, and is compatible with the published checkpoints'
config.json and safetensors format.

It builds on GPT-QModel's vendored Hugging Face Transformers v5.23.0 Llama and
Qwen2 blocks (Apache-2.0), whose attribution is in ../native/NOTICE.

The model weights are not part of this code and remain under their own
license; users loading the official checkpoints are bound by its terms.
